infographic sequence-pyramid-simple
data
  title The page degradation map
  desc Error-budget thinking applied to pixels: match each region's failure mode to its blast radius
  sequences
    - label Integrity-critical
      desc Auth, payment, cart total — fail the whole page on purpose
    - label Degradable with stale data
      desc Quotes widget — show the last tick, visibly marked stale
    - label Decorative
      desc Recommendations rail — fail to an empty slot, nobody loses money
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b #14b8a6
